This crate contains Rust FFI declarations and build discovery logic, not the
native libslirp implementation.

On non-Windows targets build.rs uses pkg-config to require a separately
supplied native libslirp version 4.2.0 or newer. On Windows it links a native
`slirp` library, optionally discovered through VCPKG_ROOT. That native library
is not vendored here and is not relicensed under MIT by this wrapper.
Upstream native libslirp source:
https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/slirp/libslirp
Native libslirp license: BSD-3-Clause.
